    "title": "Why is Friday the 13th unlucky? Why are there 3 of them in 2026?",
    "text": "ENTERTAINMENTMarch 13 is the second Friday the 13th in a row. Why is it unlucky? Kaycee SloanCincinnati EnquirerMarch 12, 2026, 10:58 a.m. ETMarch 13 may be an unlucky date this year as it falls on a Friday, making it the second of three Friday the 13ths in 2026.The unlucky date has long been a staple of pop culture, most notably being the title of the long-running film franchise of the same name, \"Friday the 13th.\" If the date brings you uneasiness, buckle up. The third and final Friday the 13th of 2026 will occur later this year.",
